				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fa17efe elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content" data-id="fa17efe" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-content.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="addtoany_share_save_container addtoany_content addtoany_content_top"><div class="addtoany_header">我要分享</div><div class="a2a_kit a2a_kit_size_60 addtoany_list" data-a2a-url="https://www.tcpttw.com/local/2026/08/29/304867/" data-a2a-title="黃忠賢參選基隆市議員持續深耕公益　攜手鎮賢宮「一件制服」助新住民學童安心上學"><a class="a2a_button_facebook" href="https://www.addtoany.com/add_to/facebook?linkurl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tcpttw.com%2Flocal%2F2026%2F08%2F29%2F304867%2F&amp;linkname=%E9%BB%83%E5%BF%A0%E8%B3%A2%E5%8F%83%E9%81%B8%E5%9F%BA%E9%9A%86%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E6%8C%81%E7%BA%8C%E6%B7%B1%E8%80%95%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%80%E6%94%9C%E6%89%8B%E9%8E%AE%E8%B3%A2%E5%AE%AE%E3%80%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D%E3%80%8D%E5%8A%A9%E6%96%B0%E4%BD%8F%E6%B0%91%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E5%AE%89%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%B8" title="Facebook" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"></a><a class="a2a_button_line" href="https://www.addtoany.com/add_to/line?linkurl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tcpttw.com%2Flocal%2F2026%2F08%2F29%2F304867%2F&amp;linkname=%E9%BB%83%E5%BF%A0%E8%B3%A2%E5%8F%83%E9%81%B8%E5%9F%BA%E9%9A%86%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E6%8C%81%E7%BA%8C%E6%B7%B1%E8%80%95%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%80%E6%94%9C%E6%89%8B%E9%8E%AE%E8%B3%A2%E5%AE%AE%E3%80%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D%E3%80%8D%E5%8A%A9%E6%96%B0%E4%BD%8F%E6%B0%91%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E5%AE%89%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%B8" title="Line" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"></a><a class="a2a_button_wechat" href="https://www.addtoany.com/add_to/wechat?linkurl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tcpttw.com%2Flocal%2F2026%2F08%2F29%2F304867%2F&amp;linkname=%E9%BB%83%E5%BF%A0%E8%B3%A2%E5%8F%83%E9%81%B8%E5%9F%BA%E9%9A%86%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E6%8C%81%E7%BA%8C%E6%B7%B1%E8%80%95%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%80%E6%94%9C%E6%89%8B%E9%8E%AE%E8%B3%A2%E5%AE%AE%E3%80%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D%E3%80%8D%E5%8A%A9%E6%96%B0%E4%BD%8F%E6%B0%91%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E5%AE%89%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%B8" title="WeChat" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"></a></div></div><figure id="attachment_304889" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-304889" style="width: 750px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img fetchpriority="high" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="size-large wp-image-304889" src="https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999090487.jpg" alt="第三屆「一件制服 溫暖一個未來」暖心啟航。(圖／記者李健興 翻攝）" width="750" height="1125" srcset="https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999090487.jpg 750w, https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999090487-100x150.jpg 100w, https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999090487-683x1024.jpg 683w" sizes="(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-304889" class="wp-caption-text">第三屆「一件制服 溫暖一個未來」暖心啟航。(圖／記者李健興 翻攝）</figcaption></figure>
<p>【警政時報 李健興／基隆報導】基隆市為愛傳承關懷協會今（29）日上午10時於武崙國小視聽會議室舉辦第三屆「一件制服 溫暖一個未來」新住民學童制服暨學用品捐贈活動，針對國小新生提供全新制服及學習用品，協助新住民家庭減輕教育支出負擔。身為基隆市為愛傳承關懷協會理事長、基隆市議員參選人的黃忠賢，持續投入地方公益與弱勢關懷，此次再攜手基隆鎮賢宮共同推動公益活動，盼以實際行動陪伴孩子安心上學，也讓教育資源更加公平。</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-304890" src="https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999112885.jpg" alt="" width="1290" height="1193" srcset="https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999112885.jpg 1330w, https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999112885-150x139.jpg 150w, https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999112885-1024x947.jpg 1024w, https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999112885-768x710.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1290px) 100vw, 1290px" /></p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd">活動現場包括前立法委員林麗蟬、基隆市學校學生家長會聯合會總會長童秉浤、監事長連正忠等各界人士出席，共同見證公益行動。黃忠賢表示，教育是孩子改變人生的重要力量，不應因家庭經濟條件而有所落差，尤其部分新住民家庭在融入社會、撫育子女過程中仍面臨經濟壓力，因此協會連續第三年推動「一件制服 溫暖一個未來」，希望透過制服及學用品的實質協助，減輕家庭負擔，更讓孩子能夠帶著自信迎接新的學習階段。</p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd">黃忠賢指出，自己長期參與基隆地方公益，希望把對城市的關心化為具體行動，從兒童教育、弱勢家庭到社區關懷，都需要民間力量持續投入。此次與鎮賢宮合作，不只是捐贈物資，更希望透過公益活動凝聚基隆人的互助精神。黃忠賢也強調，未來若有機會進入市議會，將持續關注基隆弱勢家庭、新住民及兒童教育等議題，讓更多基隆孩子能獲得公平的成長與學習機會。</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-large wp-image-304891" src="https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999128992.jpg" alt="" width="1290" height="726" srcset="https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999128992.jpg 1500w, https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999128992-150x84.jpg 150w, https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999128992-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.tcpttw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787999128992-768x432.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1290px) 100vw, 1290px" /></p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd">共同主辦單位基隆鎮賢宮宮主鄭子晏表示，民間信仰除了提供心靈寄託，也應該積極投入社會公益，鎮賢宮很榮幸能與為愛傳承關懷協會持續合作，看到孩子收到新制服與學用品時露出的笑容，就是公益行動最直接的回饋。前立委林麗蟬也肯定協會及鎮賢宮長期投入新住民家庭關懷，認為社會各界共同提供教育支持，能讓新住民子女感受到社會的溫暖與肯定。</p>
<p>黃忠賢表示，公益沒有終點，地方服務也不應只停留在口號，唯有持續走進社區、了解民眾需求，才能真正解決基層面臨的問題。未來他將持續結合企業、宮廟、社團及民間團體力量，推動更多公益服務，讓「一件制服」不只代表一份物資，更象徵一份來自基隆社會的支持與祝福，陪伴孩子從校園出發，勇敢追逐自己的夢想。</p>
<div class="addtoany_share_save_container addtoany_content addtoany_content_bottom"><div class="addtoany_header">我要分享</div><div class="a2a_kit a2a_kit_size_60 addtoany_list" data-a2a-url="https://www.tcpttw.com/local/2026/08/29/304867/" data-a2a-title="黃忠賢參選基隆市議員持續深耕公益　攜手鎮賢宮「一件制服」助新住民學童安心上學"><a class="a2a_button_facebook" href="https://www.addtoany.com/add_to/facebook?linkurl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tcpttw.com%2Flocal%2F2026%2F08%2F29%2F304867%2F&amp;linkname=%E9%BB%83%E5%BF%A0%E8%B3%A2%E5%8F%83%E9%81%B8%E5%9F%BA%E9%9A%86%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E6%8C%81%E7%BA%8C%E6%B7%B1%E8%80%95%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%80%E6%94%9C%E6%89%8B%E9%8E%AE%E8%B3%A2%E5%AE%AE%E3%80%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D%E3%80%8D%E5%8A%A9%E6%96%B0%E4%BD%8F%E6%B0%91%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E5%AE%89%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%B8" title="Facebook" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"></a><a class="a2a_button_line" href="https://www.addtoany.com/add_to/line?linkurl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tcpttw.com%2Flocal%2F2026%2F08%2F29%2F304867%2F&amp;linkname=%E9%BB%83%E5%BF%A0%E8%B3%A2%E5%8F%83%E9%81%B8%E5%9F%BA%E9%9A%86%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E6%8C%81%E7%BA%8C%E6%B7%B1%E8%80%95%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%80%E6%94%9C%E6%89%8B%E9%8E%AE%E8%B3%A2%E5%AE%AE%E3%80%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D%E3%80%8D%E5%8A%A9%E6%96%B0%E4%BD%8F%E6%B0%91%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E5%AE%89%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%B8" title="Line" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"></a><a class="a2a_button_wechat" href="https://www.addtoany.com/add_to/wechat?linkurl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tcpttw.com%2Flocal%2F2026%2F08%2F29%2F304867%2F&amp;linkname=%E9%BB%83%E5%BF%A0%E8%B3%A2%E5%8F%83%E9%81%B8%E5%9F%BA%E9%9A%86%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E6%8C%81%E7%BA%8C%E6%B7%B1%E8%80%95%E5%85%AC%E7%9B%8A%E3%80%80%E6%94%9C%E6%89%8B%E9%8E%AE%E8%B3%A2%E5%AE%AE%E3%80%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D%E3%80%8D%E5%8A%A9%E6%96%B0%E4%BD%8F%E6%B0%91%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E5%AE%89%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%B8" title="WeChat" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"></a></div></div>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b10f67b tdi_100 elementor-mobile-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-post-info" data-id="b10f67b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="post-info.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<ul class="elementor-icon-list-items elementor-post-info">
								<li class="elementor-icon-list-item elementor-repeater-item-b6d29f1" itemprop="about">
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
															</span>
									<span class="elementor-icon-list-text elementor-post-info__item elementor-post-info__item--type-terms">
										<span class="elementor-post-info__terms-list">
				<a href="https://www.tcpttw.com/tag/%e5%9f%ba%e9%9a%86%e5%b8%82%e7%82%ba%e6%84%9b%e5%82%b3%e6%89%bf%e9%97%9c%e6%87%b7%e5%8d%94%e6%9c%83/" class="elementor-post-info__terms-list-item">基隆市為愛傳承關懷協會</a>, <a href="https://www.tcpttw.com/tag/%e9%bb%83%e5%bf%a0%e8%b3%a2/" class="elementor-post-info__terms-list-item">黃忠賢</a>				</span>
